<Slide style={{ background: '#F0E4D2' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 40, background: '#7E9476', borderRadius: 4 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>第 2 步：建立 EC2 實例（你的伺服器）</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 6, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.35, gap: 9, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      {[['EC2 控制台 → Instances → 撳 Launch instances',''],['Name 填 aurora-clinic'],['AMI 揀 Ubuntu 22.04 LTS（剔免費層 eligible）'],['Instance type 揀 t2.micro（1 vCPU / 1GB，免費層）'],['Key pair：Create new → 名 aurora-key → 落 .pem'],['Network：Auto-assign public IP = Enable'],['Security group：開 SSH 22(只自己IP) / HTTP 80 / HTTPS 443'],['Storage：20 GB gp3 → Launch instance']].map((s, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, borderRadius: 14, background: '#7E9476', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>{i + 1}</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#3E2A1E' }}>{s[0]}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>關鍵設定一眼睇</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3E2A1E', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 10 }}>AMI：Ubuntu 22.04 LTS{'\n'}Type：t2.micro（免費層）{'\n'}硬碟：20GB gp3（EBS 持久）{'\n'}防火牆：80 / 443 / 22</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#C0392B', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>預警：1GB RAM 可能唔夠</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#fff', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>t2.micro 得 1GB，Node + SQLite 跑得，但個網站用緊 puppeteer 截圖，可能要更多 RAM。若遲啲經常死機，將 type 升到 t3.small（收費）就穩陣。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7c6f63' }}>寶天醫館 · AWS 上線手把手教學</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7c6f63' }}>08 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
